  hint: Found near the entrance to the manor
  characterDescription: "Horse\r\nFound near the Manor\r\nOutfit inspired by the
    medieval era\r\nHector is well known for getting lost, constantly. He refuses,
    however, to admit it, often confidently leading himself and anyone he\u2019s
    with far away from where they are wanting to go. His good friend Dora is often
    sent to find him, since she seemingly always can, even when others can\u2019t.\r\n"
